{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lunar Impact is an adventure and science fiction game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become an astronaut who arrives on the Moon to explore its harsh nature and mysterious anomalies. Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of life on Earth's satellite, with its unusual landscapes and exciting missions. Build your base, craft equipment, ride a lunar rover to explore the vast lunar seas, craters, lava caves. Overcome the challenges of extreme living conditions, constant oxygen deprivation, dangerous natural phenomena such as meteor showers, prolonged moonquakes, and other unknown phenomena. As a reward, you will get abundant lunar resources and many scientific discoveries!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lunar Environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game recreates the natural conditions of the Moon to immerse you in the life of an astronaut: lunar landscapes, a thin atmosphere, gravity, a long diurnal cycle, and natural phenomena.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resources</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The moon is rich in rare earth elements. By collecting and processing lunar minerals, you can craft equipment and construct buildings required to achieve your goals.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafting and Construction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An advanced construction mechanic allows you to build your unique base. Make yoursef cosy on the Moon!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u0421ooperative mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can go to the Moon alone or with friends and family. Experience adventures and discoveries together!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Captivating Storyline</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interesting missions and tasks await you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RELEASE OF THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is in early development. The demo version is expected to be released in summer 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the demo, the game will be available in early access.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648060?t=1744472767","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648060/c928076b1b916ef2842772b973b268b55e61e565/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744472767","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648060/9fb796a51d5451873c1ab97458046b35e9212b8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744472767","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648060/9fb796a51d5451873c1ab97458046b35e9212b8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744472767","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lunar Impact is an adventure and science fiction game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become an astronaut who arrives on the Moon to explore its harsh nature and mysterious anomalies. Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of life on Earth's satellite, with its unusual landscapes and exciting missions. Build your base, craft equipment, ride a lunar rover to explore the vast lunar seas, craters, lava caves. Overcome the challenges of extreme living conditions, constant oxygen deprivation, dangerous natural phenomena such as meteor showers, prolonged moonquakes, and other unknown phenomena. As a reward, you will get abundant lunar resources and many scientific discoveries!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lunar Environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game recreates the natural conditions of the Moon to immerse you in the life of an astronaut: lunar landscapes, a thin atmosphere, gravity, a long diurnal cycle, and natural phenomena.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resources</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The moon is rich in rare earth elements. By collecting and processing lunar minerals, you can craft equipment and construct buildings required to achieve your goals.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafting and Construction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An advanced construction mechanic allows you to build your unique base. Make yoursef cosy on the Moon!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u0421ooperative mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can go to the Moon alone or with friends and family. Experience adventures and discoveries together!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Captivating Storyline</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interesting missions and tasks await you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RELEASE OF THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is in early development. The demo version is expected to be released in summer 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the demo, the game will be available in early access.</p>","developers":["Artem Rumyantsev","Aliia Rumiantseva"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648060/48864115d09ec0d1daa9ce2bb7d83114e565d235/header.jpg?t=1744472767","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124049,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124049/movie480.mp4?t=1744209790","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124049/movie_max.mp4?t=1744209790"},"name":"Lunar Impact mechanics demonstration","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto